# Trivy vulnerability ignore list
#
# These CVEs affect essential Debian system packages (perl-base, ncurses-base,
# ncurses-bin, libncursesw6) that CANNOT be removed from python:3.12-slim
# without breaking the base OS (apt marks them as essential).
#
# All entries below have status "fix_deferred" or "affected" in the Debian
# security tracker, meaning NO FIXED VERSION exists in the upstream Debian
# repository at time of writing. They cannot be resolved by apt-get upgrade.
#
# Re-evaluate when Debian releases patches for these CVEs.

# perl-base — essential Debian package (required by dpkg)
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-8376
CVE-2026-42497
CVE-2026-48962
CVE-2026-9538

# ncurses — essential Debian package (required by many system utilities)
CVE-2025-69720
